Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:06.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:18.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:26.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:33.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:40.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.74,0:00:48.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:54.53,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:58.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:02.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:09.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:21.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.54,0:22:17.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.61,0:22:23.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:28.93,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.56,0:22:36.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:46.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:51.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:58.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.45,0:23:04.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:13.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将彷徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:19.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.97,0:23:25.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:32.35,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可急着去救戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我们在这里浪费时间啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.44,0:01:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱上戈薇的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人不是食物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁敢偷吃 我就宰了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.27,0:02:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的双腿与右手上都有四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用速度把犬夜叉耍得团团转的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族正与极乐鸟一族战斗着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那似乎是为了夺取极乐鸟手上的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正因为我能看见四魂碎片所以被劫持了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这样下去 我和七宝都有可能会被吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有七宝也好 我希望他能逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.27,0:02:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦…七宝？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:03:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 叫你站起来听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 钢牙 你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这女人带出去放一下风
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里都是野兽的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害 演技太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 银太 白角
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去保护钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银太他们早就出去巡逻了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟钢牙一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:29.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？那刚才那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个…竟敢骗本大爷！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:03:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是死路啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你能变成泡泡飞起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是不知道能不能载得动戈薇啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会让你们跑掉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 去把犬夜叉他们叫来 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的丫头 看我不吃掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 不是跟你们说不准偷吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小家伙已经跑得那么远了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们去追他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你就饶了我们好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想被杀掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦…你是为了让同伴逃走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就当我的女人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢…钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人用完以后不是要吃掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那女人不是人类嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人能看见四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不只有极乐鸟有碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能收集到这附近所有的碎片哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能得到所有的碎片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们可就天下无敌了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙比普通的妖怪女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要有用得多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫做戈薇对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.91,0:05:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天开始你就是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 不要碰我啦 笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙打了钢牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人要被杀了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然叫人家做你的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样太没礼貌了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有男朋友了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是那只臭狗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:22.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是那只臭狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 是犬夜叉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我男朋友可是有着犬夜叉这个好听的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你叫他臭狗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你跟他有一腿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在胡说什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉喜欢的明明是桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.07,0:06:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样正好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就打算再见到那家伙非宰了他不可的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要那个叫犬夜叉的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个世上消失的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就没有问题了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.37,0:07:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 它们是妖狼族的同伙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 弥勒 你也来帮帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.51,0:07:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就让这些妖怪抓走好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢？法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这一带是这些妖怪的猎场的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该散落着许多狼的骨骸才对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这里却根本没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那它们果然与妖狼族联合了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的怀疑是很合理的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我被他们抓走的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.60,0:07:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以找到他们的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以救出戈薇他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:54.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要被抓走的那个就算不是我是你也行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.99,0:08:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体不是比我的更结实嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 不是要追吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先保持一段距离观察一下再说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 我要跟你交换！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得快点找到犬夜叉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也被抓走了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才离开了一下就…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.88,0:08:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我不够灵光…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs25}笨蛋 笨蛋 笨蛋 我这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 七宝 你没事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.16,0:08:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看 犬夜叉被抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战术？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜那些妖怪会带我们到妖狼族的巢穴去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族跟极乐鸟是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇现在是在妖狼族的巢穴里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里真是狼的骸骨之山啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.05,0:09:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟极乐鸟是敌人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在最讨厌的不是妖狼族和这些怪鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我放开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在最想干掉的就是弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 跟我决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这样说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们快去救戈薇小姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:35.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒你给我站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要把我丢在这里啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟兄们 都准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座山就是极乐鸟的巢穴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.97,0:10:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这座山的某处藏着拥有四魂碎片的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要找出那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 四魂之玉碎片一定就在这山中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须得到那四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快点来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被它们发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杂碎就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到四魂碎片的气息了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一边战斗一边找太难了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:54.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.31,0:10:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见四魂碎片了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿 妖狼族的小鬼 我们等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:35.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身体中有四魂碎片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们兄弟俩一直想要得到它
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你居然自己送上门来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们的想法都是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.36,0:11:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 四魂碎片在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片就在他们的嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要四魂碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我们吃掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护好戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…可是你想干什么？钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把这个刺进那家伙的嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这个去夺取它们嘴里的四魂碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能跟那傻大个交手的只有我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 大嫂 我们去安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂？你在叫我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是你啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我们少主的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 怎么连你们都乱说话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往你们那边去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点救他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:53.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会被抓回巢穴里吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:01.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.16,0:13:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.20,0:13:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 弥勒大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.21,0:14:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族跟极乐鸟正在进行决战
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之要先想办法解决掉极乐鸟才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:08.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 让我来收拾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想死的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我退下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么招术啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.07,0:14:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭狗 正麻烦的时候你却跑来捣乱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在没空陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就饶你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:38.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抓走戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要在这里跟你算总账
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.22,0:14:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 臭狗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以饶你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不准你碰我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“我的女人”？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她能看到四魂碎片的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太适合当我的女人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.10,0:15:01.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐 他这么说哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不是的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.64,0:15:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是那家伙自作多情罢了而已呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那家伙…竟敢胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.05,0:15:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱上戈薇了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇跟我在一起才幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起跟弱小的臭狗在一起要好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:25.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了不让戈薇有丝毫留恋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早晚会把你也干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也就会毫无保留地爱上我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是霸道的家伙啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 应该是惹人羡慕的性格啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开口闭口都是戈薇戈薇戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别叫得这么亲密啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 不是跟你说现在很忙的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回去快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙君 那个家伙在更上面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙…君？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要再上吗 已经快到顶了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼头你还送上自己的右手了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手臂上的碎片被抢走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次的目标是我双腿的碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你…你又想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴好好看着 瘦狼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你见识一下我有多强
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有两个四魂碎片了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:43.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大哥 力量…力量涌出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:51.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引出铁碎牙真正威力的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把那只大怪鸟一击就干掉了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经掌握了风之伤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然碍事的大怪鸟解决掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到我们两人一决高下了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.02,0:18:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然抱在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还说要决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是那种时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙受伤了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:50.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点小伤…算不了什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.26,0:18:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你撑着点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…为什么要袒护那小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:57.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这种货色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只用左手也能把你干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还敢神气啊 接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在赶快逃吧 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:13.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们闪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么故意放他们走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为…他受了这么重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们本性也还不坏…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.30,0:19:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还说他不坏？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不是被劫持还差点丧命吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话…话虽如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:42.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他也还是保护了我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然动情了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 被人家这么华丽地告白了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫戈薇怎么恨他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可笑了 我不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是极乐鸟身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和钢牙被极乐鸟抢走的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子还会回来抢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.07,0:20:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.51,0:20:11.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉下次再遇到钢牙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是又非得拚个你死我活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.71,0:20:19.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去安慰一下犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他先前真的很担心你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去他还真有点可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 让你替我担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你及时赶来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实别来救你比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看那家伙的花言巧语捧得心花怒放
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花言巧语
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说钢牙喜欢我的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很在意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.55,0:20:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在意什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本没放在心上！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就很在意嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先说清楚 我对钢牙一点意思都没有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.09,0:21:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁…谁也没问你那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上你跟他发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在怀疑我什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你刚才一直那样看我的啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要冲着我发脾气啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你有那种奇怪的误会啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:33.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想看到你这张脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:35.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你去哪好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.79,0:21:37.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.23,0:21:40.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母借我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是去找钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.31,0:21:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回自己家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:56.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇生气的时侯好可怕啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才…才不可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不怕呢！可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.44,0:23:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从开始往返与战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是我头一次这么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那家伙 我绝对不会原谅他的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.55,0:23:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是感觉有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像忘了什么重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的…我国中三年的青春
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.96,0:24:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该在现代度过的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.22,0:24:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.63,0:24:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远隔万里而相通的二人之心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.06,0:24:13.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:17.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.90,0:25:21.09,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的天敌{\pos(262,289)}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.90,0:25:21.09,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有着鸟的身体与人类的上半身{\pos(323,414)}
